<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="151225989"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:34.000"><div begin="16.853" end="45.443" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.853" end="23.273" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.853" end="17.512">今夜</span><span begin="17.512" end="17.762">微</span><span begin="17.762" end="19.692">风轻送</span> <span begin="20.425" end="21.162">把我</span><span begin="21.162" end="21.353">的</span><span begin="21.353" end="23.273">心吹动</span></p><p begin="24.147" end="30.633" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.147" end="24.768">多少</span><span begin="24.768" end="25.862">尘封的</span><span begin="25.862" end="26.561">往</span><span begin="26.561" end="27.444">日情</span> <span begin="27.646" end="28.356">重回</span><span begin="28.356" end="29.469">到我心</span><span begin="29.469" end="30.633">中</span></p><p begin="31.340" end="38.245" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.340" end="31.892">往事</span><span begin="31.892" end="33.127">随风飘</span><span begin="33.127" end="33.997">送</span> <span begin="34.920" end="35.649">把我</span><span begin="35.649" end="36.274">的心</span><span begin="36.274" end="38.245">刺痛</span></p><p begin="38.583" end="45.443" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.583" end="39.253">你是</span><span begin="39.253" end="40.360">那美梦</span><span begin="40.360" end="41.031">难</span><span begin="41.031" end="41.747">忘记</span> <span begin="42.076" end="42.871">深藏</span><span begin="42.871" end="43.091">在</span><span begin="43.091" end="44.043">记忆</span><span begin="44.043" end="45.443">中</span></p></div><div begin="45.803" end="1:14.200" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="45.803" end="52.523" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.803" end="46.487">总是</span><span begin="46.487" end="47.549">要历经</span><span begin="47.549" end="48.499">百转和</span><span begin="48.499" end="49.260">千回</span><span begin="49.316" end="50.767">才知情深</span><span begin="50.767" end="51.236">意</span><span begin="51.236" end="52.523">浓</span></p><p begin="53.023" end="1:00.064" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.023" end="53.704">总是</span><span begin="53.704" end="54.770">要走遍</span><span begin="54.770" end="55.483">千山</span><span begin="55.483" end="56.645">和万水</span><span begin="56.645" end="58.430">才知何去何</span><span begin="58.430" end="1:00.064">从</span></p><p begin="1:00.323" end="1:07.223" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.323" end="1:00.937">为</span><span begin="1:00.937" end="1:02.022">何等到</span><span begin="1:02.022" end="1:02.741">错</span><span begin="1:02.741" end="1:03.778">过多年</span><span begin="1:03.911" end="1:07.223">以后</span></p><p begin="1:07.503" end="1:14.200" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.503" end="1:08.212">才明</span><span begin="1:08.212" end="1:08.461">白</span><span begin="1:08.461" end="1:09.221">自己</span><span begin="1:09.221" end="1:10.245">最真</span><span begin="1:10.245" end="1:11.056">的</span><span begin="1:11.056" end="1:14.200">梦</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.643" end="1:31.217" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:14.643" end="1:21.163" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.643" end="1:15.353">是否</span><span begin="1:15.353" end="1:16.568">还记得</span><span begin="1:16.568" end="1:17.290">我</span> <span begin="1:18.271" end="1:19.020">还是</span><span begin="1:19.020" end="1:20.115">已忘了</span><span begin="1:20.115" end="1:21.163">我</span></p><p begin="1:21.923" end="1:31.217" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.923" end="1:22.609">今</span><span begin="1:22.609" end="1:23.719">夜微风</span><span begin="1:23.719" end="1:24.334">轻</span><span begin="1:24.334" end="1:25.272">轻送</span> <span begin="1:25.516" end="1:26.513">吹散了</span><span begin="1:26.513" end="1:27.444">我的</span><span begin="1:27.444" end="1:31.217">梦</span></p></div><div begin="1:43.644" end="2:12.264" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:43.644" end="1:50.064" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.644" end="1:44.303">今夜</span><span 